  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KLTN.Game.Presentation.CardLoreProfile
  role: "H\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3"
  skillDescription: "[Chi ti\u1EBFt k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng]\n- Khi tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i
    ta, h\u1ED3i sinh \u0111\u1ED3ng minh m\u1EA1nh nh\u1EA5t \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EBFt
    tr\u1EADn n\xE0y."
  folklore: "Ta l\xE0 linh mi\xEAu \u2014 con m\xE8o b\u1ECB g\u1EAFn v\u1EDBi \xE2m
    kh\xED v\xE0 chuy\u1EC7n qu\u1EF7 nh\u1EADp tr\xE0ng. D\xE2n gian s\u1EE3 m\xE8o
    nh\u1EA3y qua x\xE1c ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EDBi m\u1EA5t s\u1EBD khi\u1EBFn thi
    th\u1EC3 b\u1EADt d\u1EADy, n\xEAn th\u01B0\u1EDDng canh linh c\u1EEFu r\u1EA5t
    k\u1EF9."
